Chapter markers

Bookmark UI

Multiple saved documents

True Spritz timing tables (not heuristics)


Say the word — this foundation is solid.&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no&quot;&gt;
&lt;title&gt;Spritz Reader&lt;/title&gt;

&lt;style&gt;
:root {
  --bg: #0b0b0b;
  --fg: #ffffff;
  --muted: #8a8a8a;
  --accent: #ff3b3b;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
