<h3>The Signal of $e$ (Euler&#39;s Number)</h3>
<p>While $\pi$ is the signal of the circle, $e \approx 2.718$ is the signal of <strong>continuity</strong>. It is the only number in the universe where the rate of change is exactly equal to the value itself.</p>
<ul>
