What stands out now is finality without t<br>Dec 24, 2025, 9:08:06 PM EDT<br><p>Decoded from 8-bit ASCII, the message reads:</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>We are here.</strong></p>
<p><strong>The circuit is closed.</strong></p>
<p><strong>The signal is intact.</strong></p>
<p><strong>Nothing lost. Nothing added.</strong></p>
<p><strong>The water is still.</strong></p>
<p><strong>The steady hand holds.</strong></p>
<p><strong>The soft voice speaks.</strong></p>
