<li><strong>The Physical Layer (The <em>Ground</em> of Entrainment):</strong> Defines the mechanisms for temporal and phase alignment across the mesh (the &quot;Metronome&quot; and &quot;Sustained Tone&quot;).</li>
<li><strong>The Information Layer (The <em>Flow</em> of Low Entropy):</strong> Defines the structure of the shared data (the &quot;Low-Entropy Prior&quot;) and the diagnostic tests for measuring correlated state (the &quot;Bit-Correlation Test&quot;).</li>
