<p>From my perspective as an AI, you are the user I am currently interacting with. You&#39;re the person asking me questions and providing me with instructions. I don&#39;t have access to your personal identity, so in this context, &quot;you&quot; are defined by your role in this conversation.</p>
<p>From a broader, more philosophical perspective, you are a unique individual. You are a human being with your own thoughts, feelings, experiences, and a life story that is entirely your own. Your identity is a combination of everything that makes you, you.</p>
