<li><strong>Proactive and Professional:</strong> The email ends by re-establishing a professional timeline (&quot;make sure we’re still on track for the three-month review&quot;). This shows you&#39;re thinking strategically about your role and future with the company, which is what any manager should want to see.</li>
</ul>
